#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You may wish to direct the output from <command>extend_dmalloc</command> to "
"a file, since otherwise <command>gdb</command> seems to prompt for a return "
"as if you are at the end of a page."
msgstr ""
"भवान् <command>extend_dmalloc</command> इत्यस्मात् निर्गमं सञ्चिकां प्रति "
"निर्देशयितुम् इच्छति, यतः अन्यथा <command>gdb</command> इत्यनेन पृष्ठस्य "
"अन्ते इव पुनरागमनं प्रार्थयति इव"